license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-29"
keywords:
  - simulation assets
  - articulated objects
  - asset retrieval
  - robot learning
  - Isaac Sim
abstract: >-
  AffordCraft builds a physically valid simulation asset from a single RGB image
  and a task instruction by retrieval instead of generation: it locates the object
  and the part to operate, selects a matching entry from a library of articulated
  assets, and fits it to the image while keeping its parts and joints intact.
